<title>GERMANY: Deutsche Post buys 24.8 pct of Trans-o-flex.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Post buys 24.8 pct of Trans-o-flex.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Germany's postal service, Deutsche Post AG, said on Friday it had bought a 24.8 percent stake in express delivery service Trans-o-flex.</p>
<p>The Weinheim-based Trans-o-flex, with 2,200 employees, had sales of 911 million marks last year, of which 300 million marks was outside Germany.</p>
<p>The Post said it is especially interested in Trans-o-flex's foreign network.</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49-228-2609750</p>
</text>
